{"id":503,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"4期制と探究で学力を伸ばす久留米附属","feature_description":"福岡教育大学附属久留米中学校は、4期制のもとで『日本の近未来を切り拓く人材の育成』をめざし、教育課程の工夫と教育実習の充実に取り組んでいます。学力向上と人格形成の両立を掲げ、各教科・道徳・特別活動・総合的な学習の時間を関連づけたカリキュラムを編成しています。部活動も文武両道の視点で運営しています。学びの幅と学校生活の厚みを感じやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":9947,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kurumejs.fukuoka-edu.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9948,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kurumejs.fukuoka-edu.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9949,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kurumejs.fukuoka-edu.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9950,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kurumejs.fukuoka-edu.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9951,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kurumejs.fukuoka-edu.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9952,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kurumejs.fukuoka-edu.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9953,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kurumejs.fukuoka-edu.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9954,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kurumejs.fukuoka-edu.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9955,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kurumejs.fukuoka-edu.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9956,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kurumejs.fukuoka-edu.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":3328,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://kurumejs.fukuoka-edu.ac.jp/education/features.html","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-07","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"c